  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "永續決策與數據分析",
    "sub_ename": "SUSTAINABLE DECISION-MAKING AND DATA ANALYTICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程「策略決策與數據分析」旨於探討如何在考量永續發展及環境、社會與治理（ESG）觀點的前提下，精確運用數據分析進行明智決策及策略規劃。透過深入分析學術期刊中先進且引人入勝的研究，並進行專題討論，從而深化對數據分析與永續議題的理解。課程亦著重培養學生將理論落實於實際，學習如何基於分析結果制訂兼具成效與永續考量的策略，並能在多樣化情境中適切運用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course, “Strategic Decision-Making and Data Analysis,” aims to explore how to effectively utilize data analytics for informed decision-making and strategic planning under the premise of sustainable development and Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) considerations. By conducting in-depth analyses of cutting-edge and compelling research from academic journals, as well as engaging in project-based discussions, the course deepens students’ understanding of data analytics and sustainability issues. It also emphasizes cultivating the ability to apply theory in practice—learning how to develop strategies that integrate both effectiveness and sustainability considerations based on analytical findings and apply them appropriately across diverse contexts.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "應用永續視角與數據分析，制定兼顧環境、社會與治理（ESG）的決策。",
      "describe_en": "Utilize sustainability perspectives and data analytics to make ESG-aligned decisions."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "具備批判思維與量化分析能力，提出可持續的解決方案。",
      "describe_en": "Possess critical thinking and quantitative analysis skills to propose sustainable solutions."
    }
  ],
